  "description": "Bubblegum Pop is a bold, chunky bubble display font packed with playful, hand-drawn charm! Featuring rounded, puffy letterforms with a fun bouncy baseline, this font is perfect for kids’ designs, birthday party invitations, nursery wall art, greeting cards, stickers, t-shirt designs, logos, posters, and any project that needs a cheerful, energetic pop of personality.\nThis bold bubble font is perfect for crafters, small business owners, and designers who want a fun, retro, groovy display font that stands out. Great for baby shower decor, birthday banners, cricut crafts, sublimation designs, and children’s book covers.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bubblegum Pop is a bold, chunky bubble display font packed with playful, hand-drawn charm! Featuring rounded, puffy letterforms with a fun bouncy baseline, this font is perfect for kids’ designs, birthday party invitations, nursery wall art, greeting cards, stickers, t-shirt designs, logos, posters, and any project that needs a cheerful, energetic pop of personality.</p>\n<p>This bold bubble font is perfect for crafters, small business owners, and designers who want a fun, retro, groovy display font that stands out. Great for baby shower decor, birthday banners, cricut crafts, sublimation designs, and children’s book covers.</p>",
